        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Finance and Account Services never share a database. The Finance outbox and Account inbox handle at-least-once delivery safely.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
